A.b2w=new B.bJ(A.bb,"MAINTENANCE","Clogged nozzle","Simple steps to recover material flow.",A.aHy,"Work carefully: a hot nozzle can burn you. Do not use excessive force.",A.vI,A.d7,null,null)
A.aIu=s(["Stringing often comes from wet filament, high temperature or poor retraction settings.","Dry the filament if it pops, bubbles or leaves hairs between parts. This is common after humidity or temperature changes.","Store spools in a dry bag or box with anti-moisture gel packs.","Consider using a Tenkai-recommended filament dryer if you print often or live in a humid area.","Print a temperature tower to find the cleanest material temperature.","Tune retraction and travel speed in your slicer with small tests."],t.s)
