A.au6=s(["Check that belts are not loose or overly tight.","Confirm pulleys and grub screws are tight on the motor shafts.","Lower acceleration and print speed if movement is too aggressive.","Make sure cables, clips or printed parts do not collide with movement.","Clean rails or rods and lubricate only where the manufacturer recommends it."],t.s)
