A.Gz=new B.Z(A.c8,["Information","App, version and Tenkai rank","Application","Version","Rank","Noble title","No rank","No title","Apprentice","Knight","Commander","Paladin","Bronze \xb7 Novice","Silver \xb7 Intermediate","Gold \xb7 Master","Diamond \xb7 Legend","You have not yet been appointed by the Tenkai Nobility. When you support development, your symbolic title will appear here with its color and a small story within the Tenkai realm.","For your contribution to Tenkai, the Tenkai Nobility names you Apprentice of the Bronze rank. Your support unlocks 10 filaments, 10 resins, 10 extras, 15 clients, and 2 machines per type.","The Tenkai Nobility recognizes your steady support and grants you the title of Knight of the Silver rank. Your support unlocks 15 filaments, 15 resins, 15 extras, 20 clients, and 3 machines per type.","With gratitude, the Tenkai Nobility raises you to Commander of the Gold rank. Your support unlocks 20 filaments, 20 resins, 20 extras, 25 clients, and 4 machines per type.","Your extraordinary support is written into the records of the realm: the Tenkai Nobility names you Paladin of the Diamond rank. Your support removes the limit for filaments, resins, extras, clients, and machines."],t.w)
